<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21957" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέρᾰνος</span></b> , ἡ, also ὁ, <i><span class="en">
			Thphr.
			<u>Sign.</u>
			38
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>crane, Grus
				cinerea</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				448
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				710
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				614b18
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>crane for lifting weights</i>, esp. used in the theatre, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.130
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>quern</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>dance resembling the movements of the crane</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Salt.</u>
				34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Thes.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.101
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> (masc.) a
				<i>fish</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				15.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμβρος</span>
			 (Cyren.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				227.51
			</span></i>. (Cf. OHG. <i>chranuh</i>, O<i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i>
			<i>cran</i> 'crane', Lith. <i>garn[ytilde]s</i> 'stork',
			etc.)</div>
